  "body": "This doesn't appear to affect operation of the server, but it is annoying to have in the logs.\r\n\r\n```\r\nfederation_sender_1 - 2018-09-10 20:26:19,097 - synapse.http.matrixfederationclient - 250 - WARNING - federation_transaction_transmission_loop-20771366- {PUT-O-7745791} Sending request failed to REDACTED.com: PUT matrix://REDACTED.com/_matrix/federation/v1/send/1536467941257/: RequestTransmissionFailed:[ConnectionDone()]\r\nfederation_sender_1 - 2018-09-10 20:26:19,097 - twisted - 131 - CRITICAL - - Unexpected exception from twisted.web.client.FileBodyProducer.stopProducing\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/home/matrix/.synapse/local/lib/python2.7/site-packages/twisted/web/_newclient.py\", line 195, in _callAppFunction\r\n    function()\r\n  File \"/home/matrix/.synapse/local/lib/python2.7/site-packages/twisted/web/client.py\", line 1087, in stopProducing\r\n    self._task.stop()\r\n  File \"/home/matrix/.synapse/local/lib/python2.7/site-packages/twisted/internet/task.py\", line 497, in stop\r\n    self._checkFinish()\r\n  File \"/home/matrix/.synapse/local/lib/python2.7/site-packages/twisted/internet/task.py\", line 507, in _checkFinish\r\n    raise self._completionState\r\nTaskStopped\r\n```",
